==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[new|New]] [[York]] [[city|City]]}}
# '''New York, New York''', is the largest city in the [[United States of America]]. It consists of 5 [[boroughs]]: [[Manhattan]], the [[Bronx]], [[Brooklyn]], [[Queens]], and [[Staten Island]]. The city is situated at the mouth of the [[Hudson River]] in the state of [[New York State|New York]].
# [[Manhattan]].

====Usage notes====
The term {{term||New York City}} can alone refer to the borough or island of Manhattan but more often refers to the entire city spanning all 5 boroughs. The city’s official name is simply '''New York''' but is often referred to as New York City (NYC); the City of New York; or New York, New York (NY, NY), in order to distinguish it from the state of [[New York State|New York]].

